    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to No. 13 The Belfry, an attractive two-bedroom ground floor apartment offering the convenience and privacy of its own front door in this well-established residential development on Kilbarrack Road.\r\n\r\nThe property enjoys well-proportioned living accommodation, two double bedrooms with the primary bedroom further enhanced by access to a large outdoor living space with a sunny aspect, bright and airy living / dining room and a kitchen.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned, The Belfry is within easy reach of Kilbarrack and Howth Junction DART stations, Dublin Bus services, local shops, schools, parks, sporting facilities and the stunning Dublin Bay coastline. Dublin City Centre, Dublin Airport, the M1 and M50 motorways are all easily accessible making this an exceptionally convenient place to call home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch\t \tLaminate floor, light fitting\r\n\r\nOpen-Plan Dining Area/Lounge \t5.53 x 4.42\tLaminate floor, coving, centre piece, fireplace\r\n\r\nHallway \t3.45 x 1.01\tLaminate floor, coving, centre piece, hot press with shelving\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\t3.89 x 2.67\tLaminate floor, fitted wardrobes\r\n\t\t\r\nBathroom  2.71 x 1.75\t  Tiled floor & partial tiled walls, bath suite, wc, whb\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\t3.14 x 2.80\tLaminate floor, fitted wardrobes, sliding door to balcony overlooking open green space."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Own-door ground floor apartment\r\nExcellent transport links including DART and Dublin Bus\r\nGas-fired central heating\r\nClose to schools, shops, parks and coastal amenities"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Please call the office on 018462752 to make an appointment to view.\r\n\r\nNoel Kelly Auctioneers Ltd. for themselves and for the seller of this property whose agents they are give notice that the introduction and the particulars are intended to give a fair and substantially correct overall description for the guidance of any intending purchaser and do not constitute part or any offer or contract. No responsibility is assumed for the accuracy of individual items. Prospective purchasers ought to seek their own professional advice. All descriptions, dimension areas, references to conditions and necessary permissions for use and occupation and other details are given in good faith, and are believed to be correct, but any intending purchaser should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact, but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them."
      }
